<title>UK: WestHyp sets 100 mln mark 10-year REX-linked bond.</title>
<headline>WestHyp sets 100 mln mark 10-year REX-linked bond.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-07-22</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following bond was announced by lead manager Dresdner Kleinwort Benson.</p>
<p> BORROWER   WESTFALISCHE HYPOTHEKENBANK AG</p>
<p> AMT    100 MLN DEM   COUPON    *5.4 PCT   MATURITY    15.AUG.07</p>
<p> TYPE   REX-LINKED    ISS PRICE  99.90     PAY DATE    15.AUG.97</p>
<p> FULL FEES  UNDISC    LISTING    FFURT     DENOMS (K)  ONE</p>
<p> NOTES	*TO 15.AUG.98 THEN STEPS-UP TO 81 PCT OF THE 10-YEAR</p>
<p>		 REX YIELD SUB-INDEX THEREAFTER.</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 7658</p>
</text>
